# Base URL for the backend (Render service) — drives BOTH endpoints:
#   GET  /api/github-contributions   (activity heatmap)
#   POST /api/chat                   (AI chat assistant)
#
# dev — leave UNSET (recommended): same-origin requests work out of the box
#   Vite proxies /api -> http://localhost:4000 (see vite.config.ts),
#   and if you bypass the proxy the widget falls back to http://localhost:4000.
#
# prod — set it on Vercel to the Render service URL (cross-origin; the
# backend's FRONTEND_URL must then include this site's URL):
# VITE_API_URL=https://portfolio-github-api.onrender.com
